WEBVTT

00:02:58.750 --> 00:03:02.184
Our renewal rate was 95 percent,
but by the end of the first week,

00:03:02.208 --> 00:03:04.059
I hadn't gotten a single renewal

00:03:04.083 --> 00:03:06.143
and I'd promised a refund to three clients

00:03:06.167 --> 00:03:09.018
who were unhappy
with their ads for the prior year.

00:03:09.042 --> 00:03:12.566
I think that made me the first person
in the 40-year history of the company

00:03:12.590 --> 00:03:14.840
to lose money that was
already on the books.

00:03:16.083 --> 00:03:18.684
The technical term for this
is agreement bias,

00:03:18.708 --> 00:03:20.643
and it happens when you're so agreeable

00:03:20.667 --> 00:03:23.620
that you accept a bad deal
instead of pushing for a better one.

00:03:25.167 --> 00:03:28.976
Out of desperation,
I took a crash course in negotiation.

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:31.708
I learned how to disagree
without being disagreeable.